The Director General of Police, Meghalaya, Smti Idashisha Nongrang, IPS, felicitated the personnel of the Anti-Narcotics Task Force (ANTF), Meghalaya, at a programme held in Police Officers' Mess, Golf Links, Shillong on 14th October 2026, in recognition of their dedicated service in the fight against drug trafficking. The personnel were also provided with safety vests and helmets to strengthen their protection in the field.

